WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Geometry becomes behavior

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A read must earn trust

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Boundaries before batches

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Weights that actually learn

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
One objective, many owners

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Verify before accepting

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
A reference becomes a proposal

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Inspect what really happened

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Prediction meets consequence

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Keep the work that survives
